# Collected corpus (W1-0b). Derived data, grows unboundedly, and contains
# third-party content -- redistributing it in the repo is exactly what
# timeline.md section 10 warns against. Regenerate with collector.py.
backend/data/*.sqlite3
backend/data/*.sqlite3-journal
